[TOC]



### Prerequisites:
- The device network can access the Internet normally, for example: 4G dial-up is successful or wired network routing is successful or WiFi connection is successful, refer to &gt;&gt;&gt; &quot;Network Function&quot; article introduction!

### Operation steps:

1. The device is issued through local tools, remote plug-ins, etc. For specific methods, refer to the &quot;Function Use&quot; &gt;&gt;&gt; &quot;Function--Configuration Tool&quot; article introduction

1. Copy the first and second configuration parameters of the registration platform and issue them
Register the basic parameters and the parameters of channels 1-4:
```xml
&lt;VariCfgSec Action=&quot;DEVICE_SET&quot;&gt;
&lt;stGB28181 ucFD_Enable=&quot;1&quot; ucFD_Version=&quot;1&quot; ucFD_TcpSip=&quot;0&quot; ucFD_TcpMedia=&quot;0&quot; ucFD_AutoGps=&quot;0&quot; ucFD_TalkChn=&quot;0&quot; strFD_Manufacturer=&quot;BBC&quot; strFD_ModelName=&quot;M51Hv&quot; strFD_ServerIp=&quot;139.9.251.220&quot; usFD_ServerPort=&quot;6608&quot; strFD_ServerID=&quot;34017101041328000012&quot; strFD_ServerDomain=&quot;8000012&quot; strFD_DeviceId=&quot;281812016&quot; usFD_DevicePort=&quot;5888&quot; strFD_DeviceUser=&quot;34017101041328000012&quot; strFD_DevicePass=&quot;123456&quot;  &gt;
&lt;stGB28181SubID&gt;
&lt;SUBDEVID_0 strFD_LensId=&quot;34017101041328000012&quot; /&gt;
&lt;SUBDEVID_1 strFD_LensId=&quot;34017101041328000013&quot; /&gt;
&lt;SUBDEVID_2 strFD_LensId=&quot;34017101041328000014&quot; /&gt;
&lt;SUBDEVID_3 strFD_LensId=&quot;34017101041328000015&quot; /&gt;
&lt;/stGB28181SubID&gt;
&lt;/stGB28181&gt;
&lt;/VariCfgSec&gt;
```
&gt; Parameter Notes:
ucFD_Enable=&quot;1&quot;:Function enabled and sub-stream uploaded;&quot;0&quot;Function disabled;&quot;129&quot;Function enabled and main stream uploaded
ucFD_Version=&quot;1&quot;:GB28181 version 2022;&quot;0&quot; GB28181 version 2016
ucFD_TcpSip=&quot;0&quot;:sip UDP protocol;&quot;1&quot;sip TCP protocol
ucFD_TcpMedia=&quot;0&quot;:media UDP protocol;&quot;1&quot;media TCP protocol
ucFD_AutoGps=&quot;0&quot;:location data needs to be subscribed;&quot;1&quot;location data is sent automatically
ucFD_TalkChn=&quot;0&quot;:voice channel auto;&quot;1&quot;voice channel CHN
strFD_Manufacturer=&quot;BBC&quot;:device manufacturer
strFD_ModelName=&quot;M51Hv&quot;:device model
strFD_ServerIp=&quot;139.9.251.220&quot;:server IP or domain name
usFD_ServerPort=&quot;6608&quot;:server port
strFD_ServerID=&quot;34017101041328000012&quot;:server ID number
strFD_ServerDomain=&quot;8000012&quot;:server domain
strFD_DeviceId=&quot;281812016&quot;:device ID number
usFD_DevicePort=&quot;5888&quot;:device port
strFD_DeviceUser=&quot;34017101041328000012&quot;:authentication username
strFD_DevicePass=&quot;123456&quot;:authentication password
SUBDEVID_0 strFD_LensId=&quot;&quot;:configure the first channel ID number
SUBDEVID_1 strFD_LensId=&quot;&quot; configure the second channel ID number, and so on

 Register the parameters of channels 5-8, and configure the &quot;SUBDEVID_ &quot; parameters according to the number of video channels of the device
```xml
&lt;VariCfgSec Action=&quot;DEVICE_SET&quot;&gt;
&lt;stGB28181 StartChn=&quot;4&quot; &gt;
&lt;stGB28181SubID&gt;
&lt;SUBDEVID_4 strFD_LensId=&quot;34017101041328000016&quot; /&gt;
&lt;SUBDEVID_5 strFD_LensId=&quot;34017101041328000017&quot; /&gt;
&lt;SUBDEVID_6 strFD_LensId=&quot;34017101041328000018&quot;  /&gt;
&lt;SUBDEVID_7 strFD_LensId=&quot;34017101041328000019&quot;  /&gt;
&lt;/stGB28181SubID&gt;
&lt;/stGB28181&gt;
&lt;/VariCfgSec&gt;
```

 Query the basic registration parameters and the parameters of channels 1-4
 ```xml
&lt;VariCfgSec Action=&quot;DEVICE_QUERY&quot;&gt;&lt;stGB28181&gt;&lt;/VariCfgSec&gt;
```
 Query the basic registration parameters and the parameters of channels 5-8
 ```xml
&lt;VariCfgSec Action=&quot;DEVICE_QUERY&quot;&gt;&lt;stGB28181 StartChn=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;/VariCfgSec&gt;
 ```

3. After the parameters are issued successfully, the device needs to be restarted for them to take effect

4. Enter the device system's WEB interface to check if the connection is successful, or check if the platform is online
